{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Orange Cat 是一款 Markdown 筆記編輯器，能把零散想法整理成結構清晰、日後易於重讀的文字。無論是隨手記下的短筆記，還是持續修訂的長篇文稿，都可以在同一個介面完成。此工具原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合習慣以 Markdown 寫作的學生、寫作者與上班族。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-23.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>並排預覽與版本比對</h2>\n<p>編輯與預覽並排顯示，可切換專注模式只留文字，或以閱讀模式檢視成果。修改時可手動或自動建立版本，瀏覽筆記歷史並逐行比對差異。另備內置搜尋快速找回筆記，按月份整理內容，寫作可匯出為 Markdown，外觀與字體可自行調整，常用功能亦設鍵盤快捷鍵。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-1.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-2.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-3.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-4.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Orange Cat: Markdown Editor</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/orange-cat-markdown-editor/id6798054566?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.525091+00:00","quality":